MATRIX: Functions, booleans, string repeat, and the absolute grind.

ESCAPE THE MATRIX

HUSTLE net WITH revenue AND cost
  CASH OUT revenue MINUS cost
DONE HUSTLING

BUGATTI profit EQUALS CALL net WITH 9000 AND 1200
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI "Net: " PLUS profit

BUGATTI motto EQUALS "Cobra" TIMES 3
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI motto
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI "Length: " PLUS CALL length WITH motto

BUGATTI dip EQUALS MINUS 42
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI CALL absolute WITH dip

IF SIGMA AND NOT BETA THEN
  WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI "Logic holds. The Matrix does not."
PERIOD

IF profit IS NOT THE SAME AS 0 THEN
  WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI "Still in the game."
OTHERWISE YOU ARE A BETA
  WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI "Broke behavior."
